version_info_misc_stuff         \n0xff8888Wasmagetron:0xRESETT A browser-native multiplayer grid arena.\n\nWasmagetron is an independent WebAssembly port built from the open-source Armagetron Advanced project, bringing its multiplayer arena gameplay to desktop and mobile browsers.\n\n0xff8888Source code on GitHub:0xRESETT https://github.com/enrich-genius/armagetronad\nThe exact source this build was made from.\n\n0xff8888Licensing:0xRESETT https://github.com/enrich-genius/armagetronad/blob/release_0.2.9-wasm/LICENSES.md\nGPL-2.0-or-later, and how to reproduce this build.\n\n0xff8888Contributing:0xRESETT https://github.com/enrich-genius/armagetronad/blob/release_0.2.9-wasm/CONTRIBUTING.md\nHelp port open-source games to WebAssembly.\n\nArmagetron Advanced is the work of its own authors and contributors. Wasmagetron is not affiliated with, nor endorsed by, the Armagetron Advanced project, Disney, or any Tron rights holder.\n\nBrought to you by Enrich Genius, a platform for ported browser games.

